      "description": "Product Description\nUSB Rechargeable LED Bicycle Headlight Bike Head Light Front Rear Lamp Cycling\nFeatures:\nUSB rechargeable bicycle taillight and auto cut off when fully charged.\nHigh quality internal lithium battery,only need about 2 hours to be fully\ncharged while be used for about 12 hours.\nLong Steady Bright----2 Hours\nSlow Flash----10 Hours\nSuper Flash----6 Hours\nStrobe Flash----8 Hours\n4 modes: Long Bright, slow flash, explosion flash and strobe.\nSuper waterproof, make you riding freely regardless of rain.\nHigh brightness and energy saving LED.\n\nFront Light (USB Rechargeable):\nMaterial: PC+ABS\nSize: Approx.65mmx29mmx23mm\nLight Source: XPE 3W LED\nLight Color: Black\nOutput (Maximum): 300lm\nLighting Distance: 30-50meters at night\n3 Working Modes: High-Medium-Strobe\nPower Source: 800mAh Li-Poly Battery\nCharging Time: Approx.3hours\nRunning Time:\nHigh: 3 Hours\nMedium: 5 Hours\nFlashing: 12 Hours\nFit Handlebar: 20-40mm\n\nRear Light (USB Rechargeable):\nSize: Approx.7.5×3×2cm\nBulb Type: LEDs\nBrightness: 15 lumens\nColor: Red\nLED Light: White, Red\nPackage Weight: Approx.50g\nMounting Placement: Bicycle Seat Post\nSuitable Tube Diameter: Approx.12-32mm\n\nPackage Included:\n1×Black Front Light\n1×Red Rear Light\n\n\nNote:\n1. Due to the light and screen difference, the item's color may be slightly different from the pictures.\n2.Please allow 2-4mm differences due to manual measurement.",
